---
import Footer from "../components/Footer";
import MainHead from "../components/MainHead.astro";
import NavHero from "../components/NavHero";
---

<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <MainHead
            title="About | Liz Ainslie"
            description="About me and my work."
        />
    </head>
    <body>
        <NavHero>
            <div
                class="py-32 flex flex-col items-center text-center topography"
                style="fill: #1e2329;"
            >
                <h1 class="font-display text-6xl font-light text-white">
                    About Me
                </h1>
            </div>
        </NavHero>

        <main class="container mx-auto my-12">
            <article class="content">
                <h2>Hi, I'm Lizzy! 👋</h2>
                <p>
                    I am a 22 year old full stack engineer from Arizona 🌵. My
                    hobbies include video games, code, and music. I use It/She
                    pronouns. 🏳️‍⚧️
                </p>
                <p>
                    I enjoy building data-intensive software tailor-made for
                    businesses and teams and their specific use cases. I've
                    built everything from <a href="/projects/holoui-builder"
                        >custom editing software for a Minecraft plugin's
                        configs</a
                    >, to a <a href="/projects/compass">compass app</a>, to a
                    <a href="/projects/timezonedb"
                        >platform using web extensions to display user timezones
                        in other social media platforms</a
                    >. I pride myself on building beautiful, maintainable and
                    highly functional software that is easy to use and
                    understand. My favorite projects involve solving complex,
                    domain-specific problems for people whose needs lie outside
                    of conventional software solutions in their industries.
                </p>
                <p>
                    I push all of my public code to GitHub <a
                        href="https://github.com/LizAinslie"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="nofollow noreferrer">@LizAinslie</a
                    >, and most of my personal projects are public. I also
                    occasionally enjoy streaming on <a
                        href="https://twitch.tv/LizAinslie"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="nofollow noreferrer">my Twitch Channel</a
                    >.
                </p>

                <h3>How to contact me</h3>

                <p>
                    I'm generally open to chat with anyone as long as you can
                    hold a proper adult conversation (it's the internet, you'd
                    be surprised). If you want to reach me for any reason, (i.e.
                    just to chat, to discuss business, to play a game) you can
                    use one of the following methods:
                </p>

                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Join my Discord at <a
                            href="https://discord.gg/crackcafe"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="nofollow noreferrer">discord.gg/crackcafe</a
                        >
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        DM me on Twitter <a
                            href="https://twitter.com/gxthw1tchm3y"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="nofollow noreferrer">@LizzyReborn</a
                        >
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Send an email to <a href="mailto:lizzy@lizainslie.dev"
                            >lizainslie16@gmail.com</a
                        > (For personal reasons)
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Want to donate?</h3>

                <p>
                    Because of my slightly shaky financial state as of recently,
                    I do accept donations. However I ask that before donating
                    you make sure you take care of your own needs and the needs
                    of your friends/loved ones. If anything I do or make helps
                    you in any way, shoot me a message! I love hearing how my
                    creations make people's lives better. You can donate using
                    the sites below:
                </p>

                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Patreon: <a
                            href="https://patreon.com/LizAinslie"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="nofollow noreferrer">patreon.com/LizAinslie</a
                        >
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Ko-Fi: <a
                            href="https://ko-fi.com/lizainslie"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="nofollow noreferrer">ko-fi.com/lizainslie</a
                        >
                    </li>
                    <li>Cash App: <b>$lizainslie16</b></li>
                </ul>
            </article>
        </main>

        <Footer />
    </body>
</html>
